      "created_at": "2013-08-30T17:58:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Cryo Bot says that whenever he takes damage, he deals each non-hero Target 1 damage.</p><p>We know that returning damage effects (like Flame Barrier) can interrupt the effect of deal all ___ damage and potentially end the chain if it is destroyed.</p><p>So if you Wrest the Mind on Cryo Bot, and he gets hit for 1 damage, he would deal all non-hero targets 1 damage.</p><p>Use wrest the mind to redirect the last instance of damage to Cryo Bot. &nbsp;See where I am going with this?</p><p>You just have to change the damage type to non-cold and make sure it deals at leasst one damage to Cryo.</p><p>Cryo triggers and interrupts the follow-thru on Wrest the Mind to deal all non-hero targets one damage.</p><p>Just repeat until he is at one health, then let him deal damage to all the targets, wrest the mind will then kill him and deal no damage to Visionary.</p><p>If you have a +1 damage on Cryo (other than TtE) you can deal three damage to all but one Non-hero target, then deal one non-cold damage to Cryo to set him off again.</p><p>That's an easy 18 damage to all but one non-hero target.</p><p>If you want you can then use Mental Divergence (twice) and Robot Reclamation to set it up again.</p><p>If you can raise damage by 2 and get a -1 damage taken on Cryo you can up that to 24 to each target. &nbsp;Worth the effort to set up.</p><p>Is there anything wrong with this?</p><p>All three cards use the text whenever damage, so I imagine this would work.</p>",
